{"siren:A city archive has digitised its most frequently requested documents. Officials describe the portal as representative of local history. Yet requests have mainly come from established researchers; records used by smaller community groups remain largely uncatalogued. The portal improves access to a selection, not necessarily to the breadth of the archive.":"73f7979eeeedac80e859fd1ec2421c222bf51b92046b26deb71d3c8e43580900","lauren:Take this, please.":"495d59fb8e9470a261ba8020c8c8658661440a27b37433caccf13892c7f9a184","lauren:Apparently, my schedule is so flexible that even chaos can fit in.":"0eac1b392f122ec206691f7f930315abd0e351105dad559b68a2de0b0172b9e6","lauren:I can accept that if we adjust the scope.":"bc24c6aedafc596c731d6a7a98606a35264f5d477e6c0b71da441ddf8244e4ad"}